OL,3,GNEWSAHusband charged with murder of
OL,4,Awife in her 60s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 68-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe murder of his wife in South
OL,8,FGloucestershire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,11,Faddress on Overnhill Road in Downend,
OL,12,Fnear Bristol, shortly after 01:45 BST
OL,13,Fon Sunday.
OL,15,FAvon and Somerset Police said Jill
OL,16,FBillett, 69, was found with serious
OL,17,Finjuries and was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fwhere she died a few hours later.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
