OL,3,GNEWSAHusband charged with murder of
OL,4,Awife in her 60s
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeoffrey Billett was arrested at the
OL,7,Fscene and charged with her murder. He
OL,8,Fhas been remanded in custody and is due
OL,9,Fto appear at Bristol Magistrates' Court
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
